//!   - *Foundational paper quantifying anomalous delta-V in 6 Earth flybys. Empirical formula: delta-v/v ~ 2*omega_E*R_E*(cos(delta_i) - cos(delta_o))/c. Baseline for all flyby anomaly work.*
